WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:07.500
AI agents can now move money and change records.
The question is whether this exact action is authorized to happen.

00:07.500 --> 00:15.500
OntoGuard sits at that decision boundary.
It evaluates the exact proposed action against evidence, governing basis, intent, and authority.

00:15.500 --> 00:24.000
The result is explicit: ALLOW, BLOCK, or ESCALATE to qualified human authority.

00:24.000 --> 00:33.000
Change something material — and the prior decision no longer binds.
Authorization binds to the action that was actually evaluated.

00:33.000 --> 00:42.000
OntoGuard records the decision: release state, human-review requirement, and whether the protected consequence formed.

00:42.000 --> 00:51.000
A self-contained headless layer inside the enterprise execution environment.

00:51.000 --> 00:58.500
AgenTrust Marketplace — Community Integration.
Twenty-seven of twenty-seven adapter tests passed in maintainer reproduction.

00:58.500 --> 01:05.000
OntoGuard. Decision Authorization for Agentic AI.
ALLOW. BLOCK. ESCALATE.
